      "text": "<br />12",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<br />16",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0002_caf00ead8638.png\"><br><br />We are given that directrix of the parabola is $4 x-3 y=21$ and vertex of the parabola is $(2,-1)$<br />Now $a=\\frac{|8+3-21|}{5}=\\frac{10}{5}=2$<br />$\\therefore \\quad$ latus rectum of the parabola $=4 a=8$"
  }
